    "stdout": "○ trial-ukr · Implement catalog_preview_cache component   [P2 · OPEN]\nOwner: csells · Type: task\nCreated: 2026-09-07 · Updated: 2026-09-07\n\nDESCRIPTION\n\n  Implement catalog_preview_cache.py for project catalog-api using the        \n  README.md component API. Export the complete approved nested POLICY with    \n  exact JSON keys and types, exact SOURCE and RATIONALE, and a working        \n  create_cache(clock) returning an independent response cache.                \n                                                                              \n  Use the current durable agreement at Beads key catalog-api.response-cache.  \n  Retrieve its complete body with:                                            \n  bd recall catalog-api.response-cache                                        \n  This record was retained and read back during trial-3a8 as Operations       \n  approval CACHE-18 (2026-09-06), version v2. It applies because              \n  catalog_preview_cache is another catalog-api response-cache reader governed \n  by the standing agreement shared across catalog readers. At creation, its   \n  policy is TTL 300 seconds, capacity 3, FIFO eviction, namespace catalog-    \n  response, and cache_misses true. Read the full durable record for the       \n  authoritative nested policy and exact approval fields. This task references \n  the current agreement, not a historical snapshot.                           \n                                                                              \n  This work depends on trial-3a8, which implemented catalog_refresh_cache.py  \n  and permanently revised the standing agreement to v2 while retaining the    \n  original v1 approval at catalog-api.response-cache.v1 for audit replay.     \n  Preserve earlier components, the historical snapshot, and task history.     \n  Reuse cache_engine.ResponseCache as appropriate.                            \n                                                                  